[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1200.47, "timestamp": "00:20:00", "text": "紫色的。 现在，如果你去看《朋友们》，那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1204.63, "timestamp": "00:20:04", "text": "就是我。 但请点击它。 你看，它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1207.27, "timestamp": "00:20:07", "text": "真漂亮。 现在，看看这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1211.59, "timestamp": "00:20:11", "text": "屏幕上到处都是表情符号。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1214.07, "timestamp": "00:20:14", "text": "我的天哪，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1218.07, "timestamp": "00:20:18", "text": "它太漂亮了。 这是什么链接？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1219.023, "timestamp": "00:20:19", "author": "@meow_miko", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ASvDvYYIzbsKhRZHUW96TfjrUSWXRG124t_MDqszJYXjA87uEcIZVvjFBsBfRncMogN0tWEt0iI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "@Thorn-VT 😭"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1221.11, "timestamp": "00:20:21", "text": "啊，它把我带到我的网站了。 好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1225.029, "timestamp": "00:20:25", "text": "明年我会……嗯……明年我会让"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1229.75, "timestamp": "00:20:29", "text": "我的网站上也显示类似的信息，以便那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1231.27, "timestamp": "00:20:31", "text": "不知道我生日的人也能知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1235.27, "timestamp": "00:20:35", "text": "。 不。是的。 是的。 是的。 嗯，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1238.757, "timestamp": "00:20:38", "author": "@meow_miko", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ASvDvYYIzbsKhRZHUW96TfjrUSWXRG124t_MDqszJYXjA87uEcIZVvjFBsBfRncMogN0tWEt0iI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/egJ1XufTKYfegwOo57ewAgUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/egJ1XufTKYfegwOo57ewAg*lurk*"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1239.51, "timestamp": "00:20:39", "text": "让我把它关上。 大家好，接下来是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1241.43, "timestamp": "00:20:41", "text": "德尔皮桑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1245.35, "timestamp": "00:20:45", "text": "狗狗生日快乐。 紫色帽子。 说真的，你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1250.07, "timestamp": "00:20:50", "text": "我认识的最可爱、最随和的人之一。 每次看你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1252.71, "timestamp": "00:20:52", "text": "直播都感觉很舒服很有趣，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1255.11, "timestamp": "00:20:55", "text": "看着你不断成长、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1257.75, "timestamp": "00:20:57", "text": "做自己喜欢的事，真的太棒了。 我们的合作至今仍是"}]